WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.800
For those of you who I haven't met yet, I'm Ben.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:10.400
I've been leading the relaunch, or the monetization, as we call it,

3
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.950
of BeReal since the last 10 months now, here in the US.

4
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.100
I'm based in Los Angeles.

5
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.900
I have a small but mighty team, essentially composed of salespeople

6
00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:28.200
that go to brands and agencies to explain the value proposition of BeReal.

7
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:31.700
So hopefully you're all familiar with the app now,

8
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:37.400
but we're the alternative to the big ones, the Instagram and the TikTok.

9
00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.300
We're the only AI-free social media.

10
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.600
We're the place where you never have to wonder if what you see is real or not,

11
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.950
and we're essentially the place where you can connect with actual human beings

12
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.400
and hopefully people you care about.

13
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:58.200
And it's been very encouraging to see so many of you

14
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:03.900
truly motivated by the idea of doing something,

15
00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:09.250
or participating in this big project

16
00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.600
that is making BeReal culturally relevant, ultimately.

17
00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.650
So thank you for joining.

18
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:21.050
Excited to bring BeReal to the level of hype and virality

19
00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:25.300
that it was a few years back when it blew up, especially in the US.

20
00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:31.150
And so those PMs are really the catalysts, the enablers of the features

21
00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:35.650
that make the users stay on the app, stick to the app,

22
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:42.500
but also tell their friends about it

23
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:45.100
and what keeps them coming back to the app, essentially.
